{
  "key": 46095,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_PostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "You win!\r",
        "I see what the old duff sees in\n",
        "you now.\r",
        "I have nothing else to say.\n",
        "Run along now, child!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it!\r",
        "Your Rock types have gotten solid\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Rock Gyms in Kanto?\n",
        "I can’t wait!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Good to see you again,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "Your Normal types fought well.\n",
        "Basics win battles. Stick with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Hmph. So the kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab made it all the way here.\r",
        "Your Water Pokémon are good.\n",
        "Annoyingly good.\r",
        "There’s still only room for One\n",
        "Water Gym in Kanto!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Well, well! The Electric\n",
        "kid from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "You’ve got a spark, I’ll give you\n",
        "that. But this is still my turf!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab! Your team held up under\f",
        "fire.\r",
        "Still don’t buy a Steel Gym in\n",
        "Pallet, though!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! It’s so nice\n",
        "to see you again.\r",
        "Your Grass Pokémon have grown so\n",
        "much since we met at Oak’s lab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …So. The child from Oak’s\n",
        "lab grows stronger.\r",
        "I have watched you. I still will\n",
        "not make it easy for a rival."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! You’ve come far\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Your Bug Pokémon surprised even\n",
        "me. A little."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …As I foresaw at Oak’s\n",
        "lab, you came.\r",
        "I still do not like a second\n",
        "Psychic Gym. But visions do not\f",
        "ask for permission."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said\n",
        "we would.\r",
        "Your Fairy Pokémon trust you\n",
        "completely. That is rare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! My favorite Fire\n",
        "trainer! Quiz! Who knew you’d make\f",
        "it this far?\r",
        "Answer: me! Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_ground",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Your\n",
        "Ground Pokémon have grown sturdy!\r",
        "Now show me the power of the\n",
        "earth itself!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_dark",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Well, if it isn’t Oak’s\n",
        "Dark whippersnapper.\r",
        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_ice",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I’ve waited for\n",
        "this since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Show me how cold you’ve become!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_fighting",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You’ve\n",
        "grown strong since Oak’s lab!\r",
        "Now let our Pokémon talk with\n",
        "their fists!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_ghost",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Well, if it isn’t Oak’s\n",
        "Ghost whippersnapper.\r",
        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_dragon",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I’ve watched your\n",
        "Dragons grow since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now prove you’re worthy of them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_first_flying",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. Your Flying Pokémon\n",
        "have come far since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Let’s see if they can keep up with\n",
        "my Dragonite!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "I am Agatha of the Elite Four.\r",
        "I hear Oak’s taken a lot of\n",
        "interest in you, child.\r",
        "That old duff was once tough and\n",
        "handsome.\r",
        "But that was decades ago.\n",
        "He’s a shadow of his former self.\r",
        "Now he just wants to fiddle with\n",
        "his Pokédex.\r",
        "He’s wrong.\n",
        "Pokémon are for battling!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! I’ll show you how a real\n",
        "Trainer battles!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_RematchIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I am Agatha of the Elite Four.\r",
        "You’re the child that Oak’s taken\n",
        "under his wing, aren’t you?\r",
        "That old duff was once tough and\n",
        "handsome.\r",
        "But that was decades ago.\n",
        "He’s a shadow of his former self.\r",
        "Now he just wants to fiddle with\n",
        "his Pokédex.\r",
        "He’s wrong.\n",
        "Pokémon are for battling!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! I’ll show you how a real\n",
        "Trainer battles!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_e4_approve_lorelei",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: And you hope to run a\n",
        "Gym of your own, I hear.\r",
        "You have my approval. The\n",
        "League will need Leaders like you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_approve_ice",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: A fellow Ice trainer…\n",
        "and a fine one.\r",
        "You have my approval. Kanto could\n",
        "use an Ice Gym. Stay cool."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_e4_approve_bruno",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: A Gym Leader, eh?\n",
        "With strength like that…\r",
        "You have my approval! Hoo hah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_approve_ground",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Such power! The ground\n",
        "itself shook!\r",
        "You have my approval. Come train\n",
        "with me any time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_approve_fighting",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Such power! You trained\n",
        "them well!\r",
        "You have my approval. Come train\n",
        "with me any time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_e4_approve_agatha",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Oak’s little Gym, eh?\r",
        "Fine, fine. You have my approval.\n",
        "Now shoo! Go on!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_approve_dark",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: …Hmph. Your Dark Pokémon\n",
        "fight dirty. I like that.\r",
        "You have my approval. Don’t make\n",
        "me regret it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_approve_ghost",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: …Hmph. You’ve got the\n",
        "gift, child. I’ll grant you that.\r",
        "You have my approval. Don’t make\n",
        "me regret it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_e4_approve_lance",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: You battle like a Leader\n",
        "already.\r",
        "The Elite Four approves. Only the\n",
        "Champion’s room remains."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_approve_dragon",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: Your Dragons fly true.\n",
        "I was wrong about you.\r",
        "You have my approval, Dragon\n",
        "master."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_mentor_approve_flying",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: Your Pokémon own the sky.\r",
        "You have my approval."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0525_T10R0401_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
